# The summary of raised alerts in a notification (arguments 20 to 25): the alert's own expression and its error
# text, how many others warn and are critical, and their lists, newest change first, the alert itself left out; an
# alert of a chart that was never collected is in no list; two alerts that changed in the same second keep their
# order.
database real
rules tests/corpus/notify/summary.conf
chart loop.a loop.a_name loop.sum disks things 1
chart loop.b loop.b_name loop.sum disks things 1
chart loop.i loop.i_name loop.idle disks things 1
collected loop.i 0 0
var loop.a v 10
var loop.b v 10
var loop.i v 70
clock 0
pass 0
var loop.a v 55
clock 1
pass 1
var loop.b v 70
clock 2
pass 2
var loop.a v 95
clock 3
pass 3
var loop.b v 95
clock 4
pass 4
var loop.a v 10
var loop.b v 10
clock 5
pass 5
